{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_001","lb_range":["0001a01"],"text_zh":"趙州和尚因僧問狗子還有佛性也無州云無尾文","text_en":"A monk asked Zhaozhou whether a dog has buddha-nature. Zhou said: Wu.","type":"dialogue","confidence":1}
{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_002","lb_range":["0001a02"],"text_zh":"師云好雪片片不落別處僧問如何續文","text_en":"The master said: good snow, flake by flake. Wumen says: practice requires real practice.","type":"dialogue","confidence":1}
{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_003","lb_range":[],"text_zh":"無門曰參須實參悟須實悟","text_en":"","type":"commentary","confidence":1}
{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_004","lb_range":["0001a03"],"text_zh":"前有帶入行首乙版行不收","text_en":"Carried-lb paragraph translation.","type":"prose","confidence":1}
{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_005","lb_range":["0001a05"],"text_zh":"春有百花秋有月　夏有涼風冬有雪","text_en":"Spring has flowers, autumn the moon.","type":"verse","confidence":1}
{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_006","lb_range":[],"text_zh":"條目內嵌段條目尾文","text_en":"","type":"prose","confidence":1}
{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_007","lb_range":[],"text_zh":"自閉注前自閉注後","text_en":"","type":"prose","confidence":1}
{"unit_id":"fx1-t-kitchen-sink_008","lb_range":[],"text_zh":"容器內段落","text_en":"","type":"prose","confidence":1}
